McHale is making his Broadway debut as Rocky Horror &#8216;s Brad &#8211; he took over the role August 25 from original cast member Andrew Durand &#8211; and has dedicated his performance to Glee &#8216;s Cory Monteith, who died of an accidental overdose in 2013. In his Playbill bio, McHale writes, "For Cory. His Forever Brad," a reference to a Glee episode in which the students staged Rocky Horror with Monteith's Finn playing the role of Brad. (On Glee , McHale was the Rocky Horror Narrator, the role currently being played on Broadway by Margaret Cho.)

